{"articleNo":"226777","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=226777&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] [구미상공회의소] 경북청년 구직자 자격증 응시료 지원사업 안내(수정)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2019.07.16","hit":"9497","attachments":[{"name":"2019 청년취업 자격증응시료 지원사업 신청서(수정).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=226777&attachNo=81133"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움,dotum; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">1. 대&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 상</span></strong></span></strong></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;:&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>주민등록상 경북 거주&nbsp;청년</strong></span></strong>(만 34세이하, 군경력 포함시 만 39세까지)</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br></p><span style=\"font-family: 돋움,dotum; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">2.&nbsp;지원내용</span></strong></span></strong></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;:&nbsp;구직활동(희망회사/직무)에&nbsp;도움이 되는 자격증 응시료 80%지원(한도 10만원)</span></span><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; * 1인&nbsp;</span><u><span style=\"font-family: 돋움,dotum; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">1회</span></strong></span></u><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"> 지원금 신청가능(한도금액이 남았더라도 </span><strong><u><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">1회만</span></u><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"> </span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">신청가능)</span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; * 19. 4. 10부터 응시한 시험에 한해&nbsp; 2개 이상의 응시한&nbsp;자격증시험 기재가능</span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;ex) 토익(5만원), 토스(5만원), 컴활(3만원)&nbsp;합계 13만원, 80% 10만&nbsp;4천원&nbsp;▶ 10만원 지원</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; 토익(5만원), 토스(5만원) 합계 10만원, 80% 8만원 ▶ 8만원&nbsp;지원</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; * 19. 4. 10 이전 응시한 시험 지원불가</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움,dotum; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">3. 신청기한</span></strong></span></strong></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;: 19. 4. 10 ~ 사업비 소진시</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움,dotum; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">4. 신청방법</span></strong></span></strong></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"> : 첨부파일의 신청서, 개인정보동의서 작성, 구비서류와 함께 스캔 후 메일(</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"> </span><a><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">yjh4771@naver.com</span></a><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">)송부<span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><strong><u><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">**접수사실뿐만 아니라 응시사실을 증빙 해야함(응시확인서, 성적확인서, 토익의 경우 성적확인서)</span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">**주민등록상 거주지 대구, 경북소재 대학교 재학중 -&gt; 주민등록상 거주지가 경북이 아니므로 지원불가</span></u></strong></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><strong><u><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><br></span></u></strong></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong><u><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">※ 청년 구직활동 지원금 수혜자 중복지원 불가</span></u></strong></span></strong></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><u></u></span></strong></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
